  "question": "设 $f(x, y)$ 在点(1,1)处可微，且 $f(1, 1) = 1$ ， $f_x(1, 1) = 2$ ， $f_y(1, 1) = 3$ ， $\\varphi(x) = f(x, f(x, x))$ ，求 $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}[\\varphi^3(x)]}{\\mathrm{d}x}\\Bigg|_{x=1}$ .",
  "answer": "$$ \\left. \\frac {\\mathrm{d} [ \\varphi^ {3} (x) ]}{\\mathrm{d} x} \\right| _ {x = 1} = 3 \\cdot 1 ^ {2} \\cdot 1 7 = 5 1. $$",
