    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 $\\varphi(x)$ 虽然是一元函数，但却有多重复合关系，记 $w = f(u, v)$ ，则函数的结构图如图4.1所示.\n\n$$\n\\frac {\\mathrm{d} [ \\varphi^ {3} (x) ]}{\\mathrm{d} x} = 3 \\varphi^ {2} (x) \\varphi^ {\\prime} (x).\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "记 $f(x,y)$ 的两个变量分别为1,2，则\n\n$$\n\\varphi^ {\\prime} (x) = f _ {1} (x, f (x, x)) + f _ {2} (x, f (x, x)) [ f _ {1} (x, x) + f _ {2} (x, x) ],\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "又 $\\varphi(1) = f[1, f(1, 1)] = f(1, 1) = 1$ ，则\n\n$$\n\\varphi^ {\\prime} (1) = f _ {1} [ 1, f (1, 1) ] + f _ {2} [ 1, f (1, 1) ] \\left[ f _ {1} (1, 1) + f _ {2} (1, 1) \\right] = 2 + 3 (2 + 3) = 1 7.\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "图4.1\n\n所以\n\n$$\n\\left. \\frac {\\mathrm{d} [ \\varphi^ {3} (x) ]}{\\mathrm{d} x} \\right| _ {x = 1} = 3 \\cdot 1 ^ {2} \\cdot 1 7 = 5 1.\n$$"
      }
    ],
